        Locked Out? Need New Keys? We Come To You.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg mb-8">
        Fast, professional mobile locksmith services for homes, vehicles, and businesses — emergency lockouts, on-site key replacement, and security upgrades across Dover and nearby Delaware communities.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm font-semibold">
        <span>✓ Mobile Service</span>
        <span>✓ Automotive</span>
        <span>✓ Residential</span>
        <span>✓ Commercial</span>
        <span>✓ Emergency Locksmith</span>
